From 0146b3253ea9437f0d58907c615da81b7af53e52 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arbion Halili <a.halili@protonmail.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 02:49:17 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] feat(castore/fs): serve declared tree metadata

Load the configured declaration file once per root, serve `user.*` attributes,
and retain `snix.*` entries as internal policy. Treat failures as no metadata
and include declaration identity in file and directory inode keys.

Change-Id: I882149ae234e35a29feb7e4323b16b36bb7a5dd4
